# Hint-row clicks on a list, a form, the help box and a confirm: Ins and
# Ctrl-E are the list's hint words, Esc the form's, F1 typed; the help box
# takes Up/Down and PgUp/PgDn from the hint row; Y and N answer the
# question Del asks.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I
T I
S LIST
C 23 14
S INS
C 23 11
S GAP
C 23 23
S ESCH
K F1
S H0
C 23 5
S DOWN
C 23 22
S PGDN
C 23 10
S UP
C 23 20
S PGUP
C 23 33
S CLOSED
C 23 22
S CTRLE
C 23 23
S CANCEL
K DEL
S CONF
C 23 9
S NO
K DEL ESC
S ESCNO
K DEL
C 23 4
S DELETED
K ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
